                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-group+cohomology"} ∞-group cohomology group
                of
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi G
                        %mi int
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G_{int}
                which plausibly matches, as before, the intuition one would have about internal symmetry groups acting on K-theoretically classified phases of matter;
            %li
              %p
                \..on the external symmetry group factor (shonw on the left) manifestly identifies the
                = succeed "-group" do
